---
description: Data loading & preprocessing guardrails (cluster-friendly).
globs:
  - "src/train/**/*.py"
  - "src/finetune/**/*.py"
  - "src/**/data*/**/*.py"
  - "data/**/*"
---

## Purpose
Robust, reproducible data loading and preprocessing, friendly to clusters.

## Applies When
- Training/finetune modules and data modules/files match the globs above.

## Do
- Use efficient loaders; default `num_workers=0` unless explicitly overridden by config.
- Stream/iterate large datasets; avoid full in-memory loads.
- Centralize transforms; log filtering/normalization steps.
- Validate input schema and dtypes; fail fast with actionable messages.
- Persist split indices; ensure reproducible splits across runs.

## Don’t
- Don’t mutate datasets in-place without logging.
- Don’t rely on implicit randomness; seed all split/generator ops.

## Commands / Checklist
- Emit dataset size, split counts, and sample schema at startup.
